 viewBox="0 0 300 65" role="img" aria-label="Budget allocated toward funding goal"><text id="budgetGoalLabel" x="12" y="20" font-size="12" fill="#12382D">Funding goal</text><path d="M12 44H288" stroke="#D9DECD" stroke-width="10" stroke-linecap="round"/><path id="budgetAllocation" d="M12 44H12" stroke="#12382D" stroke-width="10" stroke-linecap="round"/><circle id="budgetAllocationDot" cx="12" cy="44" r="8" fill="#C7F35C" stroke="#12382D" stroke-width="2"/></svg><div class="stats"><div class="stat"><strong id="budgetTotal">R0</strong><small>allocated</small></div><div class="stat"><strong id="budgetDifference">R0</strong><small id="budgetDifferenceLabel">left to allocate</small></div></div></div>
<label for="budgetItemSelect">Choose an item</label><select id="budgetItemSelect"></select>
<label for="budgetItemName">Item name</label><input id="budgetItemName" maxlength="60" placeholder="e.g. Sewing machine">
<label for="budgetItemAmount">Amount (whole rand)</label><input id="budgetItemAmount" type="number" min="1" max="1000000" step="1" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="e.g. 2500">
<div class="toolbar"><button class="secondary" id="budgetAdd">Add item</button><button class="ghost" id="budgetRemove">Remove item</button></div><button id="budgetSave" style="width:100%">Save budget</button><p class="feedback" id="budgetFeedback" role="status"></p><p class="caption">Total must match the funding goal. Cancel discards unsaved edits. This demo saves for this session only.</p>
</section>
<section class="screen" id="organiserProfile">
<div class="topline"><h2>Meet the organiser</h2><button class="ghost" id="profileBack">Back</button></div><p class="subtitle">The person behind the hustle.</p>
<div class="stage"><svg viewBox="0 0 300 90" role="img" aria-label="Organiser initials avatar"><circle cx="150" cy="45" r="38" fill="#C7F35C"/><path d="M96 79Q150 96 204 79" stroke="#12382D" stroke-width="4" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round"/><text id="profileInitials" x="150" y="55" text-anchor="middle" fill="#12382D" font-family="system-ui,sans-serif" font-weight="800" font-size="26">FMH</text></svg><h3 id="profileName" class="profile-text">Organiser</h3><p class="description profile-text" id="profileBusiness">Business not provided</p><small id="profileStatus" class="badge">Not verified</small></div>
<div class="profile-info"><small class="profile-label">Town or city</small><p id="profileLocation" class="profile-text">Not provided</p><small class="profile-label">About the organiser</small><p id="profileBio" class="profile-text">No bio added yet.</p></div><button class="secondary" id="profileEdit">Edit my profile</button><p class="caption">Self-reported demo profile. No identity or business verification has been performed. No account, payments or publishing.</p>
</section>
<section class="screen" id="organiserEditor">
<div class="topline"><h2>Organiser profile</h2><button class="ghost" id="organiserCancel">Cancel</button></div><p class="subtitle">Choose what supporters see.</p>
<div class="stage"><svg viewBox="0 0 300 90" role="img" aria-label="Preview of organiser initials"><circle cx="150" cy="45" r="38" fill="#C7F35C"/><text id="organiserInitials" x="150" y="55" text-anchor="middle" fill="#12382D" font-family="system-ui,sans-serif" font-size="26" font-weight="800">FMH</text></svg></div>
<label for="organiserName">Public display name *</label><input id="organiserName" maxlength="60" placeholder="Your name or chosen public name" autocomplete="off">
<label for="organiserBusiness">Business or hustle name</label><input id="organiserBusiness" maxlength="70" placeholder="e.g. My sewing studio" autocomplete="off">
<label for="organiserLocation">Town or city (optional)</label><input id="organiserLocation" maxlength="60" placeholder="Town or city, not your street address" autocomplete="off">
<label for="organiserBio">Short bio (optional)</label><textarea id="organiserBio" maxlength="220" placeholder="Tell supporters about your experience and your hustle."></textarea><div class="toolbar"><button id="organiserSave">Save profile</button></div><p class="feedback" id="organiserFeedback" role="status"></p><p class="caption">No ID, phone number, bank details or street address needed. Changes last for this session only.</p>
</section>
<section class="screen" id="photoEditor"><div class="topline"><h2>Campaign photos</h2><button class="ghost" id="photoCancel">Cancel</button></div><p class="subtitle">Show your hustle. Add up to 3 photos.</p>
<div class="stage"><div class="topline"><span class="badge" id="photoCoverLabel">No photos yet</span><small id="photoCounter">0 / 3</small></div><svg id="photoPlaceholder" viewBox="0 0 300 145" role="img" aria-label="Add a photo of your business"><rect x="70" y="20" width="160" height="105" rx="14" fill="#EAF2D9" stroke="#12382D" stroke-width="3"/><circle cx="185" cy="48" r="12" fill="#FF8A4C"/><path d="M82 110L124 65L153 94L176 76L219 111Z" fill="#C7F35C" stroke="#12382D" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M135 9H165M150 1V17" stroke="#12382D" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg><img id="photoPreview" class="campaign-photo" alt="Selected photo preview" hidden></div>
<label for="photoInput">Choose JPEG, PNG or WebP (10 MB each max)</label><input id="photoInput" type="file" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp" multiple>
<label for="photoCaption">Caption (optional)</label><input id="photoCaption" maxlength="80" placeholder="e.g. My sewing workspace" disabled>
<div class="toolbar"><button class="secondary" id="photoNext">Next photo</button><button class="ghost" id="photoRemove">Remove</button></div><button class="ghost" id="photoCover">Use as cover photo</button><button id="photoSave">Save photos</button><p class="feedback" id="photoFeedback" role="status"></p><p class="caption">Use photos you own or have permission to share. Images are resized for this demo and stay in this session only. Nothing is uploaded or published.</p></section>
<section class="screen" id="dashboard">
<div class="topline"><h2>Creator dashboard</h2><button class="ghost" id="dashboardBrowse">Browse</button></div><p class="subtitle">Your campaigns. Your next steps.</p>
<div class="stage"><svg viewBox="0 0 300 110" role="img" aria-label="Total funding progress across your demo campaigns"><circle cx="58" cy="55" r="39" fill="#EAF2D9" stroke="#D9DECD" stroke-width="9"/><circle id="dashboardRing" cx="58" cy="55" r="39" fill="none" stroke="#12382D" stroke-width="9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-dasharray="245.05" stroke-dashoffset="245.05" transform="rotate(-90 58 55)"/><text id="dashboardPercent" x="58" y="61" font-size="19" font-weight="800" text-anchor="middle" fill="#12382D">0%</text><text x="118" y="40" font-size="13" font-weight="700" fill="#12382D">Combined funding goal</text><text id="dashboardGoal" x="118" y="63" font-size="18" font-weight="800" fill="#12382D">R0</text><text x="118" y="84" font-size="10" fill="#4C6255">Demo contributions, not a balance</text></svg></div>
<div class="stats"><div class="stat"><strong id="dashboardRaised">R0</strong><small>demo raised</small></div><div class="stat"><strong id="dashboardCount">0</strong><small>campaigns</small></div><div class="stat"><strong id="dashboardDonations">0</strong><small>donations</small></div></div>
<div id="dashboardEmpty"><strong>Your first hustle starts here.</strong><p>Create a demo campaign to manage its story, budget, photos and organiser profile.</p></div>
<div id="dashboardTools" hidden><label for="dashboardCampaign">Your campaigns</label><select id="dashboardCampaign"></select><p id="dashboardStatus"></p><p id="dashboardSetup"></p><label for="dashboardAction">Manage selected campaign</label><select id="dashboardAction"><option value="details">View campaign</option><option value="story">Edit campaign story</option><option value="budget">Edit budget</option><option value="photos">Edit photos</option><option value="profile">Edit organiser profile</option></select><button id="dashboardManage">View campaign</button><div id="dashboardActivity" aria-live="polite"></div></div>
<div class="toolbar"><button id="dashboardNew">New campaign</button></div><p class="caption">Only campaigns you create in this session appear here. No real payments, available balance or payouts. Closing this demo clears your work.</p>
</section>
<section class="screen" id="campaignEditor"><div class="topline"><h2>Edit campaign</h2><button class="ghost" id="campaignEditorCancel">Cancel</button></div><p class="subtitle">Keep your story clear and current.</p><div class="stage">Funding goal: <strong id="campaignEditorGoal">R0</strong><p class="caption">The goal stays unchanged to keep your saved budget consistent.</p></div><label for="campaignEditorTitle">Campaign name</label><input id="campaignEditorTitle" maxlength="65"><label for="campaignEditorCategory">Category</label><select id="campaignEditorCategory"><option>Food</option><option>Services</option></select><label for="campaignEditorStory">Your story and use of donations</label><textarea id="campaignEditorStory" maxlength="350"></textarea><button id="campaignEditorSave">Save campaign</button><p class="feedback" id="campaignEditorFeedback" role="status"></p><p class="caption">Edits change this demo campaign only. Nothing is published.</p></section>
<section class="screen" id="donorView"><div class="topline"><h2>My giving</h2><button class="ghost" id="donorBrowse">Browse</button></div><p class="subtitle">The hustles you have backed in this demo.</p><div class="stats"><div class="stat"><strong id="donorTotal">R0</strong><small>demo given</small></div><div class="stat"><strong id="donorCampaigns">0</strong><small>hustles backed</small></div></div><div id="donorEmpty"><div class="stage"><p><strong>Your first contribution starts here.</strong></p><p>Explore a hustle and try a demo donation. Your giving history will appear here.</p></div></div><div id="donorTools" hidden><label for="donorCampaign">Supported campaign</label><select id="donorCampaign"></select><